id: migrations
title: "protocol migrations"
kind: folder-node
status: active
updated: 2026-08-17

purpose: >
  Preserve the source, decision, compatibility boundary, authority, proof, and
  replay of structural protocol changes without rewriting history.

entries:
  - migrations/2026-08-17-canonical-extension.yawn

rules:
  - migration receipts are .yawn records
  - old source remains attributable through immutable commits or hashes
  - a migration does not promote every historical claim
  - rollback must preserve current naming, authority, privacy, and proof invariants

proof:
  source:
    - core/canonical-extension.yawn
    - spec/serialization.md
